<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>__TITLE__</title><style>__CSS__</style></head><body>
<header><div class="eyebrow">QUANTITY REPRESENTATIONS</div><h1 id="heading">__TITLE__</h1><nav><a href="compare.html">Network comparison</a><a href="epochs.html">Epoch comparison</a><a href="../docs/VIEWERS.md">Data format & instructions</a></nav>
<p id="summary"></p><div class="row"><label class="file-button">Load representations / responses<input id="upload" type="file" accept=".json,.npz" multiple></label><label>Raw response basis <select id="p-bins"><option value="6">P6 (viewer protocol)</option><option value="7">P7 (ICLR analysis)</option></select></label><button id="download-data">Download loaded projections</button><span id="import-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
<details><summary>How to add your network</summary><p>Open projected <code>representation.json</code> files directly. Multiple files can be selected together. Raw <code>.npz</code> responses require the included local server: <code>python -m iclr_repro.viewer serve</code>. Generate a dataset-specific template with <code>python -m iclr_repro.viewer template</code>; it matches images by relative path and checks the dataset manifest hash. Conversion saves only 3D projections. The bundled historical measurements work offline.</p></details>
<div class="row"><select id="add-state" aria-label="Network to add"></select><button id="add">Add panel</button><button id="all">Compare all</button><label>Columns <select id="columns"><option value="auto">Auto</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select></label><button id="png">Save PNG</button><button id="svg">Save SVG</button><span id="export-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
<div class="row" id="playback"><button id="play">▶ Play</button><button id="restart">Restart</button><label>Epoch <input id="epoch" type="range" min="0" max="90" step=".1" value="0"><input id="epoch-number" type="number" min="0" max="90" step=".1" value="0"></label><label>Epoch interval <input id="interval" type="number" min="1" max="10000" step="1" value="1"></label><label><input id="smooth" type="checkbox" checked> Smooth</label><label>Duration (s) <input id="duration" type="number" min="1" max="60" step=".5" value="8"></label><label><input id="loop" type="checkbox" checked> Loop</label><button id="gif">Save GIF · 50 fps</button></div>
<div class="row"><label>View <select id="mode"><option value="both">Ellipses + centroids</option><option value="points">Image points</option><option value="all">Ellipses + image points</option><option value="centroids">Centroids</option></select></label><label>Scale <select id="scale"><option value="normalized">Activation normalized</option><option value="rms">Projected RMS normalized</option><option value="raw">Raw response units</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="plane" checked> P plane</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="fill" checked> Fill</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="nlinks"> Same N links</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="plinks"> Same P links</label><button id="reset">Reset view</button></div>
<div class="row"><strong>Shared absolute view</strong><label>Azimuth <input id="az" type="range" min="-180" max="180" step=".1" value="-80"><input id="az-number" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step=".1" value="-80"></label><label>Elevation <input id="el" type="range" min="-85" max="85" step=".1" value="12"><input id="el-number" type="number" min="-85" max="85" step=".1" value="12"></label><label>Roll <input id="roll" type="range" min="-180" max="180" step=".1" value="0"><input id="roll-number" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step=".1" value="0"></label><label>Zoom <input id="zoom" type="number" min=".2" max="4" step=".1" value="1"></label></div>
<div class="row"><label>Image point size <input id="size" type="range" min="4" max="10" step=".1" value="6"><input id="size-number" type="number" min="4" max="10" step=".1" value="6"></label><label>Alpha <input id="alpha" type="range" min=".1" max=".9" step=".01" value=".6"><input id="alpha-number" type="number" min=".1" max=".9" step=".01" value=".6"></label></div>
</header><div id="status" role="alert">Loading measured representations…</div><main id="grid"></main><footer>Drag a panel or enter camera values to change every panel together. All arrows start at the held-out N=1 centroid; the P plane has a fixed boundary. Ellipses show one covariance standard deviation. SVG exports embed each point cloud as one image, with editable vector axes and labels. <span id="animation-note"></span></footer>
<script>window.addEventListener('error',e=>{const p=document.getElementById('status');if(p){p.hidden=false;p.textContent='Viewer error: '+e.message;}});window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',e=>{const p=document.getElementById('status');if(p){p.hidden=false;p.textContent='Viewer error: '+String(e.reason);}});</script>
<script>const BUNDLED=__DATA__;
__GIF_JS__
__JS__
</script></body></html>
